富貴。」因取吞之，是月生武帝。將產之夕，后見庭內若有衣冠陪列焉。次生衡陽宣王暢、義興昭長公主令嫕。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-012-zhang-shangrou-yixing:p001:m0007","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-012-zhang-shangrou-yixing:p001:m0018"}]}},{"id":"pu1_sk3_x8r","label":"張次惠（張尚柔祖）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"次惠","mention_ids":["c-liangshu-007-zhangshangrou:p001:m0020"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-007","source_id":"s-liangshu-007-zhangshangrou-ws1566494","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-007-zhangshangrou","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-007-zhangshangrou:p001","quote":"次惠","mention_id":"c-liangshu-007-zhangshangrou:p001:m0020"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"梁七具祖次惠、宋濮陽太守。"}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-liangshu-007-zhangshangrou-ws1566494","work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-007","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-007-zhangshangrou","raw_mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-liangshu-007-zhangshangrou:p001:m0020"],"paragraph_ids":["c-liangshu-007-zhangshangrou:p001"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-liangshu-007-zhangshangrou:p001:m0020","mention_ids":["c-liangshu-007-zhangshangrou:p001:m0020"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":1,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":1,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"1處獨立位置，1個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-liangshu-007-zhangshangrou-ws1566494"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relation